# Making Headlines (windurst 37) with Lure of the Wildcat (Windurst, group 94) accepted at Umumu (Windurst Woods): the
# wildcat's 731 (a Progress event) answers first (its finish: the wildcat bit 3), then his script: this quest's 381 (the
# Windurst Woods Scoop, bit 3), then 382, 382. Both accepted by GM.
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=31.0,-5.25,141.4 job=WAR lvl=75
login
quest Windurst.MakingHeadlines accepted
quest Windurst.LureOfTheWildcat accepted
trigger Umumu                           # the wildcat's 731
finish                                  # the wildcat's bit 3
trigger Umumu                           # his script: this quest's 381
finish                                  # the Windurst Woods Scoop; bit 3
trigger Umumu                           # bit 3, not 4: 382
finish
trigger Umumu                           # 382
finish
